  "family": "broadcast",
  "style": "xerox-flyer",
  "title": "Ban/pick board on a full pink page: stencil timer, sprayed crosses over bans, picks as tilted paper strips, a 5 x 4 hero pool and the order track",
  "use": "The draft (ban/pick) screen of a two-team game: three bans and five picks a side, a twenty-hero pool with per-tile state and the ban/pick order.",
